22	The critical mixing ratio below which PermG cannot reliably detect forward causation ($\geq 50\%$ of pairs) follows a power law in $T$:
23	\begin{equation}
24	  \alpha_c(T) \;=\; -0.542 + 4.90 \;\cdot\; T^{-0.61}.
25	  \label{eq:alpha-c}
26	\end{equation}
